
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Settings | LCRP</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/settings.css">

    <link
        rel="stylesheet"
        href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css"
    >
</head>
<body>

<div class="dashboard">

    <aside class="sidebar">

        <div class="logo">
            <h1>LCRP</h1>
        </div>

        <nav>
            <a href="/user/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
            <a href="/user/lead-management">Leads</a>
            <a href="/user/faq-management">FAQ Management</a>
            <a href="/ai/chats">AI Chat</a>
            <a href="/user/settings" class="active">Settings</a>
            <a href="/user/logout">Logout</a>
        </nav>

    </aside>

    <main class="content">

        <header class="settings-header">
            <div>
                <h1>Settings</h1>
                <p>Manage your business profile, security details, and Twilio call recovery setup.</p>
            </div>
        </header>

        <div class="flash-wrapper">
            <%- include('../component/flashmessage') %>
        </div>

        <section class="settings-grid">

            <div class="settings-card">
                <div class="card-heading">
                    <div class="card-icon">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-user"></i>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <h2>Update Profile</h2>
                        <p>Keep your business information up to date.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <form action="/user/update-profile" method="POST" class="settings-form">

                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="fullName">Full Name</label>
                        <input
                            type="text"
                            id="fullName"
                            name="fullName"
                            value="<%= user.fullName || '' %>"
                            placeholder="Enter your full name"
                            required
                        >
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="brandName">Business / Brand Name</label>
                        <input
                            type="text"
                            id="brandName"
                            name="brandName"
                            value="<%= user.brandName || '' %>"
                            placeholder="Enter your business name"
                            required
                        >
                    </div>

                    <button type="submit" class="primary-btn">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-floppy-disk"></i>
                        Save Profile
                    </button>

                </form>
            </div>

            <div class="settings-card">
                <div class="card-heading">
                    <div class="card-icon">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-lock"></i>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <h2>Change Password</h2>
                        <p>Update your password to keep your account secure.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <form action="/user/change-password" method="POST" class="settings-form">

                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="password">New Password</label>
                        <input
                            type="password"
                            id="password"
                            name="password"
                            placeholder="Enter new password"
                            minlength="6"
                            required
                        >
                    </div>

                    <button type="submit" class="primary-btn">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-key"></i>
                        Update Password
                    </button>

                </form>
            </div>

        </section>

        <section class="integration-card">

            <div class="integration-header">
                <div class="card-icon">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-phone-volume"></i>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h2>Twilio Missed Call Webhook</h2>
                    <p>Use this webhook URL in your Twilio phone number voice configuration.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="webhook-box">
                <span id="webhookUrl">
                    https://ai-powered-lcrp.onrender.com/api/webhook/<%= user._id %>/incomingcall
                </span>
            </div>

            <div class="guide">
                <h3>How to connect Twilio</h3>

                <ol>
                    <li>Log in to your Twilio Console.</li>
                    <li>Go to <strong>Phone Numbers</strong>, then open your active Twilio number.</li>
                    <li>Click the <strong>Configure</strong> tab.</li>
                    <li>Under <strong>Voice Configuration</strong>, find <strong>A call comes in</strong>.</li>
                    <li>Select <strong>Webhook</strong> as the handler.</li>
                    <li>Paste the webhook URL above into the URL field.</li>
                    <li>Set the request method to <strong>HTTP POST</strong>.</li>
                    <li>Scroll down and click <strong>Save configuration</strong>.</li>
                </ol>

                <div class="note-box">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i>
                    <p>
                        When a customer calls your Twilio number, Twilio will send the call details to this webhook.
                        The system will then forward the call to your saved phone number and create a lead if the call is missed, busy, failed, or cancelled.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

        </section>

    </main>

</div>

</body>
</html>